letter is my own, sent in my own name.<br><br>I have one question, and I =
would rather put it to you directly than guess at the =
answer.<br><br>Will you publicly disavow Donald Trump?<br><br>By that I =
mean a statement in your own name that he does not represent you and =
does not have your support. Not a comment on a single policy, and not a =
statement about the party in general.<br><br>I am asking the same =
question, in the same words, of Ryan Fazio, Steve Weir, and Jason =
Guidone. Whatever you send me I will publish in full and unedited, with =
the question and the date, at <a =
