o/reports/ahm/disavowal/</a>. If you would rather answer somewhere else, =
in the Rivereast or on your own page, that is fine. Point me to it and I =
will link it.<br><br>If you have already answered this publicly and I =
have missed it, send me the link and I will say so.<br><br>I plan to =
publish on September 17, 2026 and to update through the election. There =
is no deadline. An answer at any point gets added.<br><br>Thank you for =
